if (sender.id === "popupScript") {
console.log("Received message from popup script:", message);
}
});

In this example, the popup script sends a message to the content script with the data "some data". The content script listens for messages from the popup script and logs the received message to the console.

You can use this approach to share any data between the content script and the popup script. Just make sure to use unique message IDs to differentiate between different scripts.

